note WHAT_THIS_PASS_IS_AND_IS_NOT {
  detail """
It is not a finding about the papers or the corpus. It is the author of a rule being
its first user, on his own tools, one pass after writing it -- and finding four
instances there.

The 11 tools that refuse correctly did so because they were written to; the four that
did not were written earlier in the campaign, before the corollary was articulated.
